              "Receipts trie integrity",
              "Block validation"
            ],
            "bug_bounty_scope": "in-scope",
            "notes": "A crafted block with invalid receipt keys could trigger the assertion, crashing the client."
          },
          "test_procedure": "1. Identify the parse_deposit_requests function and trace its call to trie_get with receipt keys.\n2. Craft a malicious block via P2P containing receipt_keys that reference non-existent entries in the receipts trie.\n3. Submit the crafted block to the execution client and observe whether the assertion failure triggers a client crash.\n4. Verify that the assertion failure is logged with appropriate error context before halting.\n5. Confirm that no silent skipping of deposits occurs when trie_get returns None.",
          "bug_class": "Input Validation",
          "risk_category": "Denial of Service",
