            "bug_bounty_scope": "in-scope",
            "notes": "A crafted block with invalid receipt keys could trigger the assertion, crashing the client."
          },
          "test_procedure": "1. Locate the block validation layer that checks receipts trie integrity before deposit request parsing.\n2. Verify that block_output.receipt_keys are validated against the receipts trie root before being passed to trie_get.\n3. Test with a block containing a valid receipts root but with receipt_keys pointing to non-existent entries.\n4. Confirm that validation layers reject blocks with mismatched receipt keys before reaching parse_deposit_requests.\n5. Document any gap in validation that allows invalid receipt keys to reach trie_get unchecked.",
          "bug_class": "Input Validation",
          "risk_category": "Denial of Service",
          "notes": "Source: PROP-W5B6-59, Trust Boundary: tb-018, tb-020, Nodes: actor-execution-client, actor-state-trie"
